# MedEase Frontend Environment Variables

# Backend API URL (without trailing slash)
# Leave UNSET (or empty) for both local dev and Vercel production:
#   - In dev, Vite proxy forwards /api to localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts)
#   - In production, Vercel rewrites /api to the Render backend (see vercel.json)
# Only set this if you need direct backend access (bypasses proxy/rewrite):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# WebSocket URL (required for production on Vercel, since Vercel doesn't proxy WebSockets)
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://medease-nb52.onrender.com
